:: Michael Ask About Classmate Lucas [nobr]

<<set $Minutes += 1>>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Michael",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<<if !$CompletedQuests.includes("Michael: Little Bear")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and he raises an eyebrow before laughing. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, nice try kid. Not falling for that.”</span> Confused, you ask him what he is talking about, <span style="color:Yellow">but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> just shakes his head and walks off.</span>
<<elseif !$CompletedQuests.includes("Lucas: Punishment Game")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and he raises an eyebrow. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“The fuck you asking about him for?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span>’s posture moves to a defensive stance, and you question what the big deal is. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Listen, $MichaelNickname, you’re still new here so I’ll cut you some slack. I’m the best at what I do, and the best knows what is and isn’t smart, right? Messing with that kid? Not smart. So, whether you’re looking for a victim or a playmate, stay away from that one if you know what’s good for you.”</span>
<<else>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and he raises an eyebrow. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“The fuck you asking about him for?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> gives you a suspicious look. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“If you’re worried I’m going to mess with your little friend, don’t. Dude got another kid expelled last year, and I ain’t risking that. He may seem all nice and smiley, but trust me, when it comes down to it, he’s a snake.”</span> 
<</if>><br>
<br>
<<endByLocation>>

